shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"fFqiWGifimXWprqmQFLF2A","review_id":"WdL_ftQ9ADwgmDu9eKHn_w","date":"2011-07-27T21:20:06","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9493786096572876,"text_excerpt":"I absolutely love the WWII Museum...no question. I had zero expectations of the restaurant as 1)I've never been to a John Besh restaurant and 2)it's a museum restaurant and as much as I love the museum, I was kinda thinking it was going to be overpriced and mediocre. Well *it* is pricey, but worth it I think...I'm a fan! And while I may not make the special trip to the restaurant alone, I would definitely eat there when I visit the Museum or am in that neighborhood. The atmosphere is lovely...sophisticated, minimal and warm at the same time which is hard to pull off. The patio area is lovely as well and pulled back from the sidewalk so you don't feel like you're in the middle of street tr..."},{"business_id":"fFqiWGifimXWprqmQFLF2A","review_id":"gxYOa1Qgsy_O2-dY_DGVow","date":"2012-05-20T04:47:55","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9321386814117432,"text_excerpt":"Ate here twice during our stay in New Orleans. First stopped in because of Chef John Besh's name-- love him. Then loved their happy hour-- 75 cents for a meat pie or pulled pork slider?! shut up. So good. Great drinks. Had their chicken and dumplings (very salty, but good), beef tongue sandwich (loved it), excellent nutella cupcakes (don't get their other flavors of cupcakes), and OK monty cristo. Definitely go between 3 and 5 for their happy hour!"},{"business_id":"fFqiWGifimXWprqmQFLF2A","review_id":"hm5lEi_qg9ATEakkjxpJIQ","date":"2010-08-27T17:59:47","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9302887916564941,"text_excerpt":"I am upgrading my rating of the American Sector based on another awesome meal. There was a VIP event for the unveiling of the new expansion, so there was a flyover by a B-17 bomber. Needless to say, that was incredible. I wasn't invited to the VIP event, so I decided to have a great meal instead of schmoozing with the Mayor and other politicians. We ordered the cheeseburger sliders and the shrimp and spicy sausage po-boy. I had the po-boy and it was excellent. The shrimp were perfectly cooked and tasty. There was some sort of sauce that did make the sandwich too messy and unstable to pick up and eat, so I used my fork. Like most of the sandwiches, it comes with homemade potato chips. I do..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"fFqiWGifimXWprqmQFLF2A","photo_id":"eejAHLYVoEQnq1lWELJuRw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/eejAHLYVoEQnq1lWELJuRw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9141401052474976},{"business_id":"fFqiWGifimXWprqmQFLF2A","photo_id":"CSvPzmhuO4ssTUzNMsveEA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/CSvPzmhuO4ssTUzNMsveEA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9029725193977356},{"business_id":"fFqiWGifimXWprqmQFLF2A","photo_id":"gEl-WaZiVoAiz35-5YuPOg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/gEl-WaZiVoAiz35-5YuPOg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7573798894882202},{"business_id":"fFqiWGifimXWprqmQFLF2A","photo_id":"mnDGF8kkG50eYgsxFefZhg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/mnDGF8kkG50eYgsxFefZhg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7411048412322998}]},"notebook_case":null}
